  "description": "HIDZAY crystallizes in the monoclinic crystal system with space group P 21/n. Reported CIF formula moiety: C134 H138 N18 O16 Tb4,3(H2 O1). From the CIF bond table, Tb1 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb2 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors; Tb3 (Tb) has 6 O neighbors; Tb4 (Tb) has 7 O neighbors. Oxygen-bridged metal-site graph: 5 pairs, 1 components; largest component is a network with cycles with approximately planar metal-site arrangement. Computed bridged metal-metal separations span 3.626-3.893 Å (not direct metal-metal bonds). Computed M-O-M angles span 98.00-112.44°; individual values and O labels are in metal_framework.links. Article card reports molecular formula C134H144N18O19Tb4.",
